The editor loads these libraries from a CDN. They stay under their own
licenses and are not relicensed:

- dompdf.js 2.0.7 — MIT License
  https://github.com/lmn1919/dompdf.js
  Draws the selectable PDF from the page on screen.

- pdf-lib 1.17.1 — MIT License
  https://github.com/Hopding/pdf-lib
  Attaches document.json to that PDF and reads the attachment back.
  It does not draw the page.

- Roboto, by Google — Apache License 2.0
  https://github.com/googlefonts/roboto
  The typeface for the page and the PDF, latin subset, via Fontsource.
